  "chunks": [
    {
      "chunk_type": "isnad",
      "arabic_text": "وَفِي رِوَايَةِ الْحُسَيْنِ بْنِ عُلْوَانَ عَنْ عَمْرِو بْنِ خَالِدٍ عَنْ زَيْدِ بْنِ عَلِيٍّ عَنْ آبَائِهِ عَلَيْهِمُ السَّلَامُ عَنْ عَلِيٍّ عَلَيْهِ السَّلَامُ قَالَ:",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And in the narration of al-Husayn ibn ʿUlwān, from ʿAmr ibn Khālid, from Zayd ibn ʿAlī, from his forefathers, peace be upon them, from ʿAlī, peace be upon him, who said:"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "ذَكَرَ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ صَلَّى اللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَآلِهِ الْجِهَادَ فَقَالَتِ امْرَأَةٌ لِرَسُولِ اللَّهِ صَلَّى اللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَآلِهِ يَا رَسُولَ اللَّهِ فَمَا لِلنِّسَاءِ مِنْ هَذَا شَيْءٌ فَقَالَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "The Messenger of Allah, peace be upon him and his family, mentioned jihad. Then a woman said to the Messenger of Allah, peace be upon him and his family: “O Messenger of Allah, do women have any share in this?” So he said:"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "بَلَى لِلْمَرْأَةِ مَا بَيْنَ حَمْلِهَا إِلَى وَضْعِهَا إِلَى فِطَامِهَا مِنَ الْأَجْرِ كَالْمُرَابِطِ فِي سَبِيلِ اللَّهِ فَإِنْ هَلَكَتْ فِيمَا بَيْنَ ذَلِكَ كَانَ لَهَا مِثْلُ مَنْزِلَةِ الشَّهِيدِ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Yes. For a woman, from the time of her pregnancy until her delivery and until her weaning, there is reward like that of one stationed in the way of Allah. If she dies during that period, she shall have the like of the rank of a martyr.”
      }
    }
  ],
  "translations": {
    "en": {
      "summary": "This hadith states that a woman has a great spiritual share through the hardships of pregnancy, childbirth, and nursing. It compares her reward in that period to one who is steadfast in the way of Allah, and if she dies in that state, she receives the rank of a martyr.",
      "seo_question": "What reward does a woman receive in Islam for pregnancy, childbirth, and nursing?",
      "key_terms": {
        "الْجِهَادَ": "jihad; striving in the way of Allah mentioned as the subject of the discussion",
        "لِلنِّسَاءِ": "for women; indicating the woman's question about women's share in spiritual reward",
        "حَمْلِهَا": "her pregnancy; the beginning of the period of rewarded hardship",
        "وَضْعِهَا": "her delivery; childbirth as part of the rewarded process",
        "فِطَامِهَا": "her weaning; the completion of the nursing period",
        "الْمُرَابِطِ": "one stationed in the way of Allah; used as the comparison for her reward",
        "سَبِيلِ اللَّهِ": "the way of Allah; the path in which striving earns divine reward",
        "الشَّهِيدِ": "martyr; the rank likened to the woman who dies during this period"
      }
    }
  },
